        "Description": "Welcome to Whittleton Creek 47, \r\rYour target: Charles Blake III and all those associated with him. Charles seeks to implement deeply unethical healthcare policy within the town, mandating abortion for women who have a familial net worth below $500,000, his aid is no better.\r\rCharles is bank rolled by Olive Haskel, who is his largest donor. Spencer Green and Gunther Mueller also provide private security for Charles on occasion and must be eliminated.\r\rGodspeed Forty Seven!",
